# Core UX

```text
DISCOVER
   ↓
RECIPE
   ↓
AI MODIFY / CREATE
   ↓
PREVIEW
   ↓
USER APPROVES
   ↓
FINAL RECIPE
   ↓
COOK
   ↓
FRIDGE UPDATED
```

### 식's core idea

> **Cook with what you have.
> Change it your way.**

**Visual direction:** Korean Instagram-style minimalism — warm food photography, soft neutral background, generous whitespace, understated typography, rounded cards, subtle motion, and very little visual clutter.
